    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Opponent is at 1 life with exactly 3 mana sources (2 Great Furnace + Mountain), which is exactly enough to activate Grindstone (costs {3}, {T}). Using Wasteland to destroy a land would cut them to 2 mana, preventing Grindstone activation even if they find Painter's Servant to combo. With the opponent's only win condition being the Grindstone combo, this is a meaningful disruption opportunity.",
      "action_taken": "Passed without using Wasteland or casting any spells.",
